# Build HC.PushNotificationWorker Docker image (linux/amd64)

Publish runs **inside** the Docker build (SDK image) to avoid corrupted DLLs (`Bad IL range`) from cross-platform publish.

## Local build

```powershell
# Default tags: latest01042026 + latest
./build-pushnotification-linux-amd64.ps1

# Custom tag
./build-pushnotification-linux-amd64.ps1 -version latestlvt

# Clear local image cache before build
./build-pushnotification-linux-amd64.ps1 -version latest01042026 -ClearDockerCache
```

## GitHub Actions (CI/CD)

Workflow: `.github/workflows/build-pushnotification-docker.yml`

| Trigger | Condition |
|---------|-----------|
| Push | Commit message contains `[pushnoti]` |
| Manual | Actions → **Build PushNotificationWorker Docker image** → Run workflow |

**Image tag** (optional in commit message; default `latest01042026`):

| Tag in commit | Docker tag pushed |
|---------------|-------------------|
| `[latest01042026]` | `longnguyen1331/hc-pushnotificationworker:latest01042026` (+ `latest`) |
| `[latestlvt]` | `longnguyen1331/hc-pushnotificationworker:latestlvt` (+ `latest`) |

Example commit:

```text
[pushnoti] fix FCM credential validation [latest01042026]
```

Secrets required: `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`, `DOCKERHUB_TOKEN` (same as API/Blazor workflow).

## Deploy on server

```bash
docker compose -f etc/docker-compose/docker-compose-bv199-Production.yml pull hc-pushnotificationworker
docker compose -f etc/docker-compose/docker-compose-bv199-Production.yml up -d hc-pushnotificationworker
```

Firebase: replace `./secrets/firebase/hanh-chinh-so-firebase.json` with a **new** GCP service account key (old key `c8fb6af6...` is invalid/revoked).
